      "translation": {
        "english_lines": [
          "O speaking yaazh, doe-eyed maiden,",
          "You alone are the breeze that blows.",
          "Shall I never again hear a song like this.... (spoken)",
          "In the thalaa fire-whirl,",
          "did you wake alone?",
          "I became a yaazh that plays irredeemable sorrow.",
          "We lived by undying love—love... (spoken)",
          "As a desolate ghost upon this earth, is it not...",
          "I became a page inscribed with endless sorrow.",
          "Have you forgotten that answering affection, beloved.... (spoken)"
